    {
      "id": "https://catalog.opengrid.org/upstream/goes-psm",
      "type": "Agent",
      "name": "GOES satellite imagery processed by the NREL Physical Solar Model",
      "pointerRationale": "The satellite radiance product and the PSM retrieval behind NSRDB. Not a catalogued dataset in its own right, so it is recorded as an upstream node: PRD \u00a74.3 C7 is explicit that a field source may point at an uncatalogued source, and an absent link would read as 'no source' rather than 'not catalogued'."
